'''Luke''' (ルーク, ''Rūku'', '''Luke''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Collaboration Events|Collaboration Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Luke
|image = E 623.png
|appearance = [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Luke has a lower-sized health pool and moderate damage. His hits have a chance to be a Savage Blow, dealing 3 times the damage. He also has decent range with an Omni Strike reaching Cats up to 400 range.

==Strategy==
Damage-focused [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|backliners]] like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can defeat him easily with proper meat shielding.

